  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "A meteorite found\nat METEOR FALLS.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ruby-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/5/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A meteorite found\nat METEOR FALLS.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "emerald",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/6/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A meteorite that fell from space\nonto MT. MOON long ago.\nIt is very lumpy and hard.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "firered-leafgreen",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/7/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "もともとは　りゅうせいのたきに\nおちていた　いんせき。\nえんとつやまで　てにいれた。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "원래는 유성의 폭포에\n떨어져 있던 운석이다.\n굴뚝산에서 손에 넣었다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "原為墜落在\n流星瀑布裡的隕石。\n在煙囪山得到了它。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une météorite qui s’est écrasée sur le Site\nMétéore, trouvée au Mont Chimnée.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Meteorit, der ursprünglich bei den Meteorfällen\neingeschlagen ist. Du hast ihn beim Schlotberg\nerhalten.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Meteorito obtenido en el Monte Cenizo que antes\nse encontraba en la Cascada Meteoro.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Meteorite proveniente dalle Cascate Meteora.\nPuoi ottenerlo sul Monte Camino.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Meteorite originally found at Meteor Falls.\nYou got it at Mt. Chimney.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "元々は　流星の滝に\n落ちていた　いんせき。\nえんとつ山で　手に入れた。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
